  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing Mercury use in Artisanal and Small-scale Gold Mining (ASGM)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Projects to reduce mercury use in artisanal and small-scale gold mining (ASGM) can take different approaches, but generally work to reduce mercury demand from the ASGM sector through training and capacity building on mercury-free processing technique and/or restricting the supply of mercury.</narrative>
  </description>
